      "notes": "No hardware-fit or browser/WebGL acceptance is implied by the retained CAD or CPU geometry checks. Factory display execution is independently recorded in product limitations; a model screen only shows the actual emulator framebuffer. Native cover164.28×100.17 differs from documented PCB164×97 because they are distinct physical structures. Native PCB element has3.1mm bounding depth including its source geometry; this is not asserted to be bare FR4 thickness. Active pixelplane is derived from nominal7in diagonal and1024:600 ratio, not an inspected optical AA drawing. All native source geometry retained. Current PCB revision, undocumented package identity and material are not inferred from CAD. No physical button hit target is fabricated without calibration; verified BOOT and touch inputs use product controls. DSI framebuffer remains unsupported on these boards."
