  "collectionNotes": [
    "MIPI-DSI / DPI 图像传输未实现，当前不生成替代 framebuffer；产品尺寸/分辨率是硬件知识，不能当作显示运行通过。",
    "Goodix只在0x5D应答；未发明可控INT引脚来选择0x14。GT9271保留9271器件身份，复用官方BSP声明兼容的单点报告子集。",
    "GT911 触摸报告数字子集、I2C GPIO7/8、GPIO35 BOOT 已实现；多点、复杂配置与完整原厂界面未验证。",
    "TF 默认64MiB FAT32与已有P4 SDMMC数字模型；独立原厂文件系统挂载、C6无线、CSI、USB、音频模拟、Ethernet及模拟电源未验收。",
    "此配置使用虚拟 silicon rev3.01，仅用于匹配原始镜像范围；不是实物PCB修订声明，实际芯片应单独识别。",
    "原始出厂镜像固定提交/实际SHA，分区和每个ESP段checksum/SHA已审计；simulationVerified=false，未做本次原厂启动或实机验收。",
    "UIFlow1/2：本轮官方型号README/资源页没有列出精确目标镜像；上游专项核验未知。Xiaozhi可能作为官方Brookesia内部应用出现，但这不证明独立上游镜像可复用。",
    "3D 来源：official-cad；生产Three加载器、来源哈希、尺寸和适用部分的射线/展开复位已检验；部分结构和光学尺寸有明确限制，未宣称浏览器WebGL或实物装配通过。",
    "No hardware-fit or browser/WebGL acceptance is implied by the retained CAD or CPU geometry checks.",
    "Factory display execution is independently recorded in product limitations; a model screen only shows the actual emulator framebuffer.",
    "Native cover164.28×100.17 differs from documented PCB164×97 because they are distinct physical structures. Native PCB element has3.1mm bounding depth including its source geometry; this is not asserted to be bare FR4 thickness. Active pixelplane is derived from nominal7in diagonal and1024:600 ratio, not an inspected optical AA drawing.",
    "All native source geometry retained. Current PCB revision, undocumented package identity and material are not inferred from CAD.",
    "No physical button hit target is fabricated without calibration; verified BOOT and touch inputs use product controls. DSI framebuffer remains unsupported on these boards."
  ]
}
